OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteer-run museum gets national
OL,4,Arecognition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA volunteer-run local heritage museum
OL,7,Fdocumenting the history of an ancient
OL,8,FCotswold market town is celebrating
OL,9,Fafter being awarded official national
OL,10,Faccreditation.
OL,12,FCharlbury Museum & Heritage Centre has
OL,13,Fbeen recognised under the UK Museum
OL,14,FAccreditation scheme by Arts Council
OL,15,FEngland.
OL,17,FThe independent Oxfordshire museum said
OL,18,Fit was an "exciting opportunity to
OL,19,Fexpand and professionalise" its work in
OL,20,Fpreserving Charlbury's heritage for
OL,21,Ffuture generations.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
