OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteer-run museum gets national
OL,4,Arecognition
OL,5,
OL,6,FFounded in 1949, the museum operates as
OL,7,Fa charity and has exhibits including a
OL,8,Fmodel of the Market House, demolished
OL,9,Fin the 1870s and a restored Victorian
OL,10,Fwagon.
